# The steps of the parallel set that write the same place, so the gate runner
# (factory/core/verify.sh) never runs them at the same time: a line per set,
# space-separated (factory/core/lib/steps.sh, FACTORY_NO_OVERLAP). typecheck,
# arch and test each run Godot on the project (godot --headless --path .), which
# rewrites the project's .godot/ folder as it opens it: its import and script
# class caches, and the steps' own output under .godot/factory. Two Godot runs at
# once on one .godot/ race, so the line below keeps them, and with them lint and
# deviation, to one at a time: the parallel steps run one by one, as before.
typecheck lint arch deviation test
